# Lines any encounter ship falls back on when its own voice has none for the moment.
# $intruder is the other vessel, $ship the speaker's own hull, $distance metres between them.

# First words to a vessel in the zone, by how the ship is doing. A ship in a bad way does not threaten.
wf-npc-voice-warn-wary-1 = {$intruder}, you are {$distance} metres off our bow. We see your guns. Keep them pointed elsewhere and keep moving.
wf-npc-voice-warn-wary-2 = {$intruder}, nobody here wants a fight. Turn away and it stays that way.
wf-npc-voice-warn-hurt-1 = {$intruder}, we've had a rough day already. Don't add to it. Turn away.
wf-npc-voice-warn-hurt-2 = {$intruder}, stay back. We are still armed.
wf-npc-voice-warn-desperate-1 = {$intruder}, please, keep your distance. We aren't looking for trouble.
wf-npc-voice-warn-desperate-2 = {$intruder}, we're in no shape for this. Just fly on.
wf-npc-voice-warn-broken-1 = {$intruder}, we're dead in the water. There's nothing here for you.
wf-npc-voice-warn-broken-2 = {$intruder}, stay clear. We can barely hold air.

# The second and last warning, only from a ship that can back it up.
wf-npc-voice-final-1 = {$intruder}, this is your last warning. Turn away now.
wf-npc-voice-final-2 = Last time, {$intruder}. Open the range or we open fire.
wf-npc-voice-final-3 = {$intruder}, you have been told twice. There will not be a third time.

# Opening fire while hurt or badly hurt.
wf-npc-voice-attack-hurt-1 = {$intruder} won't back off. Fine. Everything we've got.
wf-npc-voice-attack-hurt-2 = We're hit, but we're not done. Fire on {$intruder}.
wf-npc-voice-attack-desperate-1 = They're coming for us. Fire on {$intruder}, fire on anything!
wf-npc-voice-attack-desperate-2 = We can't run from {$intruder}. Shoot!

# The other vessel fired first.
wf-npc-voice-fired-1 = {$intruder} is firing on us! Return fire!
wf-npc-voice-fired-2 = Taking fire from {$intruder}. Weapons free!
wf-npc-voice-fired-3 = {$intruder} shot first. Make them regret it.

# What the side remembers of a vessel, said once.
wf-npc-voice-recall-returned-1 = {$intruder} again. You were told to stay away.
wf-npc-voice-recall-returned-2 = Back already, {$intruder}? You don't listen.
wf-npc-voice-recall-fled-1 = {$intruder}. You ran last time. Run again.
wf-npc-voice-recall-fled-2 = Look who came back. {$intruder}, you left in a hurry last time.
wf-npc-voice-recall-killed-1 = {$intruder}, you killed our people. You don't leave this place.
wf-npc-voice-recall-killed-2 = That's the ship that took out one of ours. Nobody lets {$intruder} go.

# How the fight is going, said when it gets worse.
wf-npc-voice-hurt-1 = We're hit. Keep firing!
wf-npc-voice-hurt-2 = Hull breach, minor. Stay on {$intruder}.
wf-npc-voice-hurt-3 = That one hurt. {$intruder} is better armed than it looked.
wf-npc-voice-desperate-1 = We can't take much more of this. Break off, break off!
wf-npc-voice-desperate-2 = {$intruder}, enough! We're done, let us go!
wf-npc-voice-desperate-3 = Half the crew is down. Get us out of here.
wf-npc-voice-flee-1 = All power to engines. We're leaving.
wf-npc-voice-flee-2 = Run for it! Get us clear of {$intruder}!
wf-npc-voice-laststand-1 = No way out. Then we take {$intruder} with us.
wf-npc-voice-laststand-2 = We're finished. Make it cost them.
wf-npc-voice-laststand-3 = Nobody surrenders. Keep firing until the guns go dark.
wf-npc-voice-gloat-1 = {$intruder} is venting atmosphere. Keep the pressure on.
wf-npc-voice-gloat-2 = They're breaking up. Finish {$intruder}.

# Giving up: said on the radio, then over a hail to the victor.
wf-npc-voice-surrender-1 = This is {$ship}. We surrender. Cease fire, cease fire! Our guns are cold.
wf-npc-voice-surrender-2 = {$intruder}, this is {$ship}. We yield. Hold your fire, we're standing down.
wf-npc-voice-surrender-hail-1 = {$intruder}, this is {$ship}. We're done. Our crew are standing down and our guns are cold. Will you take our surrender?
wf-npc-voice-surrender-hail-2 = This is {$ship}. You win. We'll hold still for boarding. Do you accept?
wf-npc-voice-surrender-accepted-1 = Understood. We'll hold position. Come aboard when you like.
wf-npc-voice-surrender-accepted-2 = Thank you. Nobody aboard will resist.
wf-npc-voice-surrender-refused-1 = Then we'll go down fighting. All hands, back to your guns!
wf-npc-voice-surrender-refused-2 = No quarter? So be it. Fire!
wf-npc-voice-surrender-betrayed-1 = They're firing on a surrendered ship! All hands, fight!
wf-npc-voice-surrender-betrayed-2 = {$intruder} fired on our white flag. Take them with us!

wf-npc-surrender-option-accept = Accept their surrender
wf-npc-surrender-option-refuse = Refuse
